<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Execute</h1>
<p>The execute command has been removed. It stored a shell command in the 
file execute.dat for the server to run, but nothing ever ran it, and a 
shell typed from inside the game is more risk than it is worth. Work on 
the server is done from its command line.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Wizhelp Reboot</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Wizhelp Shutdown</a>
</pre>




</div>